<%= if @client? do %><%= if length(@accounts_with_urls) == 1, do: "Your Firezone sign-in URL", else: "Your Firezone sign-in URLs" %>

Enter <%= if length(@accounts_with_urls) == 1, do: "this URL", else: "one of these" %> on the sign-in page the Firezone app opened.
<%= for {account, sign_in_url} <- @accounts_with_urls do %>
<%= account.name %>
    <%= sign_in_url %>
<% end %><% else %>Your Firezone accounts

We found the following accounts associated with your email address.

<%= for {account, sign_in_url} <- @accounts_with_urls do %>
<%= account.name %> (<%= account.slug %>)
Sign in: <%= sign_in_url %>

<% end %><% end %>
If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email.

Thanks,
The Firezone Team
